{"resourceIdentifier":"2358","resourceName":"Nanchang Zhonglan Huanneng Technical Service Co. Ltd. Maiyuan LFG Power Generation Project","description":"Nanchang Zhonglan Huanneng Technical Service Co. Ltd. Maiyuan LFG Power Generation Project (hereinafter referred to as the Project) is located at the Nanchang Maiyuan landfill in Shuangling village, Jiaoqiao town, Nanchang Economic and Technological Development Zone, Nanchang city, Jiangxi province, P.R China.\r\nThe purpose of the project is to utilize landfill gas (LFG), which consists mainly of methane, for electricity generation. It includes LFG collection system, LFG pre-treatment system and electricity generation system. LFG collected will be used for electricity generation with internal combustion generators. The total installed capacity will be 6.402MW. The annual average amount of feed-in electricity is estimated to be 38,356MWh. The expected average annual emission reductions are 193,972 tCO2e during the fixed 10 years crediting period.","location":{"latitude":28.734998,"longitude":115.780276},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2020-11-25","endExclusive":"2020-12-26","endInclusive":"2020-12-25"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2358"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Jiangxi"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Nanchang Zhonglan Huanneng Technical Service Co. Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Jiangxi Province, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2358"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"155699"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0001"}]},{"co